**PRATICAL 1 ***

### Summary
This practical involved the implementation and time analysis of Bubble Sort, Selection Sort, Insertion Sort, Merge Sort, and Quick Sort. Each sorting algorithm was executed successfully, and their performance was compared based on execution time and efficiency for different input sizes.

### Conclusion
From this practical, I learned the working and performance of different sorting algorithms. Bubble Sort, Selection Sort, and Insertion Sort are suitable for small datasets, while Merge Sort and Quick Sort are more efficient for large datasets because of their better time complexity. This practical improved my understanding of algorithm analysis and sorting techniques.
